WEBVTT

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.570
"Family" sounds more and more like a lie, doesn't it?

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.280
What Kanzaki tried to teach you...

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:44.940
...was how hearts are easily tricked,

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:47.210
and how cruel and shallow humans are!

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.210
Like I can believe that.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:55.840
You think I believe that?!

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.270
Hey, come on.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.400
You should hurry up and finish her off.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.780
She's a demon who tricked you, anyway.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:25.290
Isn't it your job to hunt Players?

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.250
It's what Kanzaki wished for.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.790
Do your job!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:02.240
This is Chairman Amagi's private helicopter.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:02.870
The Chairman?!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.620
I want you to inform us about the situation.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.120
The Chairman's on his way to the scene now.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:25.510
Kouga?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:31.600
Enforcing justice!

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.790
Shooting Mode.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.270
Jin-kun...

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.500
Hanako!

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.430
Nice, Jin-kun.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.720
Those eyes of yours...

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.560
I can see your heart's freezing now.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.020
You're the Charisma!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.060
You'll make all the Players awaken with your Ring of Exposure!

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:05.910
Kouga...

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.460
I'm grateful to you.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:23.800
What?!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.140
Cutting Mode.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.280
Look at Jin-kun.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:49.450
Have you ever seen him look so expressionless?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:57.580
Even as he was forced to realise just how much having a heart gets in the way,

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.790
he couldn't kill Tanaka-kun.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.590
But you've done a splendid job breaking him out of all this confusion.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.970
Did Onii-chan seriously kill her?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.850
Your injuries are gunshot wounds.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.890
They weren't caused by any monsters.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.310
Could it be...

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.350
Kouga...

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.940
He followed... his own kind of justice.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:30.910
Look, I'll give you a reward.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.170
Your brother's... not to blame.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.090
Okaa-san!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.270
This is bad!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.600
The limiter shut itself!

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.690
He took too much damage now!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.610
The Alphas suit is prioritising life support!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:10.110
Kouga-kun, it's impossible for you to fight at full power anymore!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.990
Onii-chan! Okaa-san is-

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.000
Konoha! Run away!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.380
Enough already, Nii-chan!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.930
Enough of this "justice"...

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.940
Go ahead and give the finishing blow.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.040
Do it!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.580
Don't you think that Alphas is the real evil here?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.210
Even if she was just deceiving you,

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:14.840
he killed a person... no, Player, who was important to you!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.350
Jin-kun!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.660
What a great face.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.700
It looks like my dream's about to come true.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.910
And what is your dream?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.960
It's the birth of Charisma.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.460
In other words, you.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.670
I don't mind dying if it's for you.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.960
As you wish.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:14.740
Die!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:18.700
I'm fine with that, Jin-kun.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:09:59.910
This is bad!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.990
Kouga-kun's already way past his limits!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.710
So you'll save someone as long as they're human?

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.550
Don't make me keep saying this!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:18.220
She had to die in order for humanity to prosper!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.390
Why didn't you look for a way to let her live?

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:26.480
Because there's some justice you have to
protect even if it means making sacrifices!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:31.940
There's no guarantee things will always work out nicely like they did back at that fire!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.360
Sometimes you have to make painful choices!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.450
I'd save everyone.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.450
I wouldn't let anyone die!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.250
I can't call you a hero anymore.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.260
And what is a "hero"?

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.760
Someone who eradicates evil.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.390
And that's why I'll cut you down!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.520
As long as you have the Ring of Exposure,

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.850
you'll call forth Players!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.570
If you want to save humanity,

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.360
then you should die!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.780
You might be a hero,

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.320
but you're not human anymore.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.910
Stop it, Onii-chan!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.560
Shooting Mode.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.070
I'll enforce justice!

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.410
Do it!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.200
I don't give a shit about "justice".

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:11.960
No, Jin-kun!

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:46.740
Three years have passed since that last gunshot.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:52.700
Although many lives were lost in what happened that night,

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.750
the memories of it are fading.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:13:01.760
But, of the Players who had penetrated into the depths of human living,

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:06.180
those who rampage, acting only on instinct to fulfil their desires,

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.510
eventually appeared in great numbers.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.690
Enforcing justice!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.660
Thank you, Alphas!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.450
Call for me any time.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.960
Once again, Alphas has gone into action.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:47.630
Late last night, a man was attacked by a Player,

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:48.180
An announcement from our program: After this, there will be special commentary

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.390
but was saved by Alphas, who flew down from the sky.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:51.530
from our expert regarding the incident with Alphas and the Player.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.470
Well, he was amazing!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.560
He came straight down out of the sky!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.640
Alphas, thank you, seriously!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:58.480
Our program is conducting its own investigation into the identity of Alphas.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:03.650
There's data showing that the number of
attacks by Players has been drastically reduced.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:09.410
As was thought, the presence of Alphas is working to deter them!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.490
Just who is he?

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:14.160
It's been said he's a member of a special police force,

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.580
but there's been no public announcement of it...

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.330
Mr. President, Hashimoto-sama is here.
but there's been no public announcement of it...

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.120
Mr. President, Hashimoto-sama is here.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.420
Let her through.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.640
The party is at three, right?

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.690
I want the Players to keep quiet today.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.150
I'm hoping they will, too.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.280
My grandfather once said to me,

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:53.660
"If you want your justice to last, gain power!"

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:58.000
I've made those words a reality.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.810
Charisma...

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:53.610
Look up.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.110
You won't find any hope rolling around on the ground.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:08.290
Move it!

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:09.750
No!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.960
Is that your justice?

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.840
Stop it!

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:16.260
But...

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:21.140
There's no doubt that he prevented the damage from spreading even further.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.600
This is tough for Jin,

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.770
but Alphas protected our way of living.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.650
The justice you've taken upon yourself is pretty heavy.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.370
Jii-sama!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.370
Chairman Amagi?

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.410
Did Jin leave?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:45.870
Yes...

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.630
Kouga! You can't go after him!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.420
The Ring of Exposure is a double-edged sword!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.880
I can't just let him go!

00:17:56.220 --> 00:18:00.010
If Jin follows what Kanzaki taught him,

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.890
it means Haitani has lost.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.650
Even if he appears to be in his completed form,

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.480
his heart is still human!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:16.070
It's the kind of imperfection Kanzaki hoped for all along.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.780
What do you mean?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.240
Players' instincts are to slaughter.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:27.040
Kanzaki and I tried to make use of those
fighting instincts to exterminate the Players.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.790
Kanzaki taught Jin what it is to be human...

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.750
...to act as a way to stop those instincts,

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.420
predicting something like today's events might happen.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:44.180
What'll become of Jin-kun now?

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:58.240
I wonder if it's really because of Alphas that the Players have quieted down,

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:01.950
or is it... because of Zet?

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.240
It's nothing to be concerned about.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.450
You're everyone's hero!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.460
Mayu, how do you define "justice"?

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.460
You're my justice.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.220
Have you heard from your little sister?

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:36.860
Thank you.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.570
Have you had any word from Jin-kun?

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.580
No...

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.870
I wish he'd just call.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:52.710
It's frustrating that your brother's the only one who is seen as a hero.

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.090
Well, I still haven't given up on looking for him.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.590
If you hear from him, let me know.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.590
<i>If</i> I do...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.940
You're free, anyway, right?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:20.530
Let's go.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.450
We'll take you some place fun.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.620
But if I don't get home, well..

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.540
Plus Papa and Mama will be worried.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:33.160
You'll be fine if you're just a little late!

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.540
You definitely won't regret it, OK?

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.670
Who's there?

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:48.430
A monster!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.890
Your lives are finished.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:30.720
It's you.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.600
The Master would like to meet you!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.560
He'll revert if he does.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.650
He's worried about you.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.520
He should worry more about himself.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.780
Do whatever you can to watch out for Kouga.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.650
You too.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.580
No one praises him.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.160
No one notices him.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:59.670
Even so, this man continues to fight.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:01.420
For the sake of the light...

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.460
...he chose the path of darkness.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.340
That man is...
